WEBVTT

00:03.981 --> 00:08.680
So, I've ended up returning
to the world under this light.

00:10.621 --> 00:13.590
I'll show you this time!
My true power!

00:15.926 --> 00:19.760
The Asagi Style Gale Force Wind!

00:33.711 --> 00:37.511
No matter what powers you may
have, you're no match for me.

00:37.915 --> 00:41.476
No match for my
magnetic power!

00:50.995 --> 00:53.691
It's kind of getting darker.

00:53.998 --> 00:55.795
I suppose it's almost night.

00:55.900 --> 00:56.628
Night?

00:56.701 --> 00:58.259
But we're underground.

00:58.636 --> 01:02.128
The Company creates
an artificial night.

01:02.540 --> 01:05.475
So people can live the same
as those on the surface.

01:06.143 --> 01:07.110
Wow...

01:09.346 --> 01:12.338
You two, you should
spend the night with us.

01:12.416 --> 01:13.974
What? Are you sure?

01:14.552 --> 01:16.247
The people of the Underground...

01:16.320 --> 01:18.948
...have managed by cooperating
with each other.

01:19.323 --> 01:20.984
This is the least we can do.

01:22.126 --> 01:22.717
Thanks.

01:26.230 --> 01:27.788
Rumina!

01:30.201 --> 01:32.533
This lady says we can
stay with her.

01:33.037 --> 01:33.867
Really?

01:34.205 --> 01:35.399
All right!

01:36.474 --> 01:37.099
Ow!

01:37.174 --> 01:39.699
Get out of here, surface dweller!

01:39.777 --> 01:42.007
I hope the Company gets you!

01:42.346 --> 01:43.438
Why, you!

01:43.514 --> 01:46.449
Maybe you can sleep outside.

01:48.619 --> 01:50.314
All right!

01:50.387 --> 01:53.788
Aru! Mei!
It's almost dinnertime!

01:53.924 --> 01:55.084
Okay!

01:55.793 --> 01:58.227
Is he going to be eating with us?

01:58.295 --> 02:01.594
How could we eat
with surface dwellers?

02:01.766 --> 02:04.667
They're all evil,
you know.

02:05.136 --> 02:06.603
That's right!

02:07.872 --> 02:11.706
Surface dwellers
are all bad people!

02:12.643 --> 02:16.044
So let's get them out of here.

02:22.887 --> 02:27.654
The abandoned subway line leads
into darkness.

02:27.892 --> 02:30.690
At the end of this long,
long tunnel...

02:31.262 --> 02:35.130
...beneath Tokyo, this nation's capital...

02:35.699 --> 02:39.294
...there is a forgotten world
that has been sealed off.

02:39.804 --> 02:43.900
The name of this world
where the sun does not shine is...

03:06.764 --> 03:10.393
yoru no machi wa tsumetai ne

03:10.467 --> 03:14.164
kokoro umore naku nari sou

03:14.238 --> 03:17.435
mae ni susumeru ka douka daro

03:17.508 --> 03:20.170
taisetsu na koto wa

03:20.244 --> 03:22.405
oshiete yo

03:22.479 --> 03:23.912
ne

03:24.281 --> 03:29.218
hito wa hanareru tameni deau no?

03:29.286 --> 03:34.690
Machigai dato omowa sete

03:34.758 --> 03:38.455
akireru hodoni aishiteta

03:38.529 --> 03:41.965
nani mo kamo ga kira meite

03:42.032 --> 03:45.593
osoreru koto nante nani

03:45.669 --> 03:49.196
hitotsu naito shinji teta

03:49.273 --> 03:52.936
jyonetsu ga oto wo tatete

03:53.010 --> 03:56.502
kuzure ochiru shun kan wo

03:56.580 --> 03:59.811
wasure wa shinai itsu made mo

03:59.884 --> 04:03.581
modori tai nante iwa nai yo

04:03.654 --> 04:09.422
tada kimi ni mou ichido dake aitai

04:22.539 --> 04:23.207
The Traps Hidden in the Darkness

04:23.207 --> 04:26.543
The Traps Hidden in the Darkness
The Traps Hidden in the Darkness.

04:26.543 --> 04:30.035
The Traps Hidden in the Darkness

04:38.923 --> 04:39.912
You wanna fight?!

04:39.990 --> 04:42.322
I've decided not to talk to you.

04:42.393 --> 04:43.883
Aru. Mei.

04:44.094 --> 04:47.222
If you've finished washing
your hands, sit down at the table.

04:47.431 --> 04:48.523
Okay.

04:56.874 --> 04:58.239
Here you go!

04:58.375 --> 04:59.569
Wow!

04:59.810 --> 05:01.710
That looks delicious!

05:02.613 --> 05:04.774
Thank you!

05:10.688 --> 05:11.620
Thank you.

05:17.695 --> 05:18.593
Huh?

05:18.796 --> 05:20.559
Aren't you going to eat, Shiel?

05:21.699 --> 05:22.996
I'll eat later.

05:23.334 --> 05:23.959
What?

05:24.335 --> 05:25.700
Let's eat together.

05:25.836 --> 05:28.600
But I'm your bodyguard.

05:28.973 --> 05:31.942
I can't be having a meal with you.

05:32.009 --> 05:35.843
But it's more fun
if we can eat together.

05:36.447 --> 05:37.243
Fun?

05:37.748 --> 05:38.407
Yes.

05:38.882 --> 05:43.319
The last time I was here,
I always ate with Chelsea.

05:44.989 --> 05:48.481
On the surface world, Rumina
and Ginnosuke were also there.

05:48.559 --> 05:50.049
It was so much fun.

05:51.028 --> 05:53.087
So, come on.

06:02.239 --> 06:03.263
How is it?

06:03.574 --> 06:05.735
You look like you're enjoying it.

06:07.978 --> 06:10.947
There could be something
funny in this food...

06:11.015 --> 06:13.108
...so it's best that I try it first.

06:15.019 --> 06:18.785
You sure get to eat some
nice food everyday.

06:18.989 --> 06:21.514
But I have no idea how it's made.

06:24.428 --> 06:26.225
I tried to cook once...

06:26.296 --> 06:28.662
...when I was on the surface.

06:29.967 --> 06:31.366
Oh, well.

06:31.435 --> 06:33.460
It is your first time, after all.

06:34.938 --> 06:36.030
I'm sorry.

06:42.713 --> 06:47.150
What do you think you're
doing to Ruri?!

06:49.753 --> 06:53.211
That wind user guy
sure can be an airhead!

07:00.597 --> 07:01.723
Rumina...

07:04.334 --> 07:05.301
Chelsea...

07:07.538 --> 07:08.698
Ruri...

07:09.773 --> 07:12.071
Hey! That's mine!

07:12.142 --> 07:14.474
I'm not letting some
surface dweller eat it!

07:14.545 --> 07:15.273
Give it back!

07:15.345 --> 07:16.573
Rumina!

07:16.780 --> 07:18.179
Stop this!

07:18.248 --> 07:19.613
You're acting like a child!

07:19.683 --> 07:22.447
Aru! You've already got one!

07:22.519 --> 07:23.417
No way!

07:23.654 --> 07:25.246
Why, you!

07:29.827 --> 07:31.055
That was tasty.

07:32.062 --> 07:34.963
The food underground
is the same as on the surface.

07:35.032 --> 07:36.556
Of course it is.

07:36.633 --> 07:37.759
Come on!

07:38.168 --> 07:42.002
How can you behave like that
in front of guests?

07:42.072 --> 07:43.835
At dinner, even!

07:43.907 --> 07:44.839
Aru!

07:45.008 --> 07:45.975
Are you listening?!

07:46.276 --> 07:47.368
Yeah.

07:49.113 --> 07:51.274
Your beds are ready.

07:51.648 --> 07:54.014
Feel free to get some rest.

07:54.585 --> 07:56.450
Oh, thank you.

07:56.954 --> 07:59.855
You've really been good to us.

08:00.124 --> 08:01.648
Alright, then.

08:02.893 --> 08:03.723
What?!

08:03.794 --> 08:05.056
My Kogarasumaru's gone!

08:05.429 --> 08:06.088
What?!

08:07.831 --> 08:09.321
Where is it, you guys!?

08:09.399 --> 08:10.991
I don't know!

08:11.068 --> 08:13.298
Maybe you left it outside.

08:13.370 --> 08:16.498
No way!
I'm sure I brought it in...

08:16.573 --> 08:17.631
At least, I think...

08:17.708 --> 08:19.039
You're sure?!

08:19.543 --> 08:22.011
Uh... well when you put it that way...

08:22.880 --> 08:24.507
Let me go look for it.

08:25.048 --> 08:26.640
I'm going to bed.

08:28.652 --> 08:30.984
No one to interfere now.

08:32.322 --> 08:34.381
It's time to begin.

09:07.524 --> 09:08.786
What's going on?!

09:22.005 --> 09:24.769
That's Chelsea Rorec for you.

09:24.908 --> 09:29.072
Quite suitable as the bodyguard
for the Maiden of Life.

09:31.615 --> 09:34.015
An assassin from the Company?

09:34.151 --> 09:35.550
My name is Rou.

09:35.986 --> 09:36.953
A Master Warrior.

09:37.020 --> 09:39.853
I've never heard that name before.

09:39.923 --> 09:42.448
You must be
a Class-C Master Warrior.

09:42.826 --> 09:45.294
I'll soon be promoted to A-Class.

09:45.362 --> 09:50.129
Once I defeat you,
a traitor to the Company...

09:55.372 --> 09:57.840
Nerdy guy!
Take everyone and go!

09:58.275 --> 10:00.300
My name's Ginnosuke!

10:07.351 --> 10:10.218
I wish Rumina were here now.

10:10.587 --> 10:13.317
This isn't what we were told.

10:14.157 --> 10:17.354
He said he was going to
kick the surface dwellers out.

10:18.128 --> 10:19.993
What's that about, Aru?!

10:20.063 --> 10:20.722
Mei!

10:21.598 --> 10:23.088
Do you know the enemy?

10:23.200 --> 10:25.100
He said if we wanted
the surface dweller to go...

10:25.168 --> 10:27.659
...we should steal his sword.

10:28.005 --> 10:28.767
That's why...

10:28.972 --> 10:30.906
We just sneaked out with it.

10:30.974 --> 10:35.001
He was only after Chelsea.

10:35.412 --> 10:39.143
That's why he wanted to get
Rumina out of the way.

10:39.216 --> 10:42.242
What have you done, you two?!

10:42.586 --> 10:43.746
I'm sorry.

10:47.457 --> 10:51.154
Rumina, come back quick.

10:56.266 --> 10:59.667
It's cold. I've got to find my
Kogarasumaru and get back soon.

11:10.781 --> 11:12.112
You coward!

11:12.182 --> 11:13.479
Show your face!

11:14.084 --> 11:18.453
But I can see you
very clearly from here.

11:25.395 --> 11:26.362
Watch it!

11:26.596 --> 11:28.461
Chelsea!

11:31.468 --> 11:32.400
Chelsea!

11:34.271 --> 11:38.435
So you used your gravity power
to change its trajectory.

11:39.309 --> 11:40.276
However...

11:42.579 --> 11:45.207
Next time I won't miss.

11:46.683 --> 11:50.175
Those flying steel beams
suddenly changed direction.

11:51.822 --> 11:52.516
Why?

11:52.989 --> 11:55.753
Come to think of it, back then...

11:59.029 --> 12:00.189
Don't tell me...

12:09.973 --> 12:12.703
You're a user of magnetic power!

12:12.943 --> 12:14.410
Very clever.

12:15.078 --> 12:19.174
Just like you,
I have a somewhat unusual power.

12:40.804 --> 12:44.638
How much longer will you
be able to dodge my attacks...

12:44.708 --> 12:46.573
...in this darkness?

12:46.643 --> 12:48.873
It's hard to accept, but he's right.

12:49.179 --> 12:52.171
I'm barely able to get out
of the way in these conditions.

12:53.116 --> 12:54.140
There it is!

12:56.653 --> 12:58.848
I'll go and find the wind user guy!

12:58.922 --> 13:00.184
Me, too!

13:02.559 --> 13:04.925
If only she could see the attack...

13:04.995 --> 13:06.986
...she'd be able to counterattack.

13:07.531 --> 13:12.332
Do you have some powerful
lighting or an infrared scope?

13:12.402 --> 13:15.132
There's nothing like that
in this village.

13:17.207 --> 13:19.835
We might just have to wait
until morning.

13:21.878 --> 13:25.871
Daylight is artificially generated
in the Underground world.

13:26.283 --> 13:27.341
If that's the case...

13:27.851 --> 13:32.447
Could you tell me where the
power to this village comes in?

13:32.556 --> 13:33.022
What?

13:46.069 --> 13:48.936
That must be the power cable.

13:51.208 --> 13:53.199
Surface dweller!

13:53.577 --> 13:54.908
Help us!

14:00.517 --> 14:02.781
You must be at your limit.

14:20.070 --> 14:20.866
This is it!

14:24.875 --> 14:26.843
It's locked...

14:35.619 --> 14:36.677
All right!

14:44.528 --> 14:47.697
It's about time for you to give up.

14:47.697 --> 14:49.790
I see.

14:50.467 --> 14:53.163
It looks like a simple timer.

14:55.272 --> 14:57.137
If I can change the schedule...

14:58.441 --> 14:59.669
Meet your end.

15:10.754 --> 15:11.550
What?!

15:13.690 --> 15:16.318
Wh-What?!
Is it morning already?!

15:16.960 --> 15:18.018
Hey!

15:19.062 --> 15:20.051
You guys...

15:21.531 --> 15:22.896
That's my Kogarasumaru!

15:22.966 --> 15:23.933
We're so sorry!

15:24.000 --> 15:25.763
But that girl's in trouble!

15:26.469 --> 15:27.561
Blondie?!

15:30.540 --> 15:32.531
Light makes no difference now!

15:32.776 --> 15:33.743
Die!

15:37.047 --> 15:38.036
What the...?!

15:38.915 --> 15:42.510
I just added a little gravity
to the steel beam.

15:42.986 --> 15:45.477
It's heavy to begin with,
so it's pretty easy.

15:46.723 --> 15:51.490
Your attack doesn't bother me
at all as long as I can see it!

15:51.561 --> 15:52.425
Why, you!

15:56.499 --> 15:58.262
This time it's my turn.

15:59.703 --> 16:02.536
Throwing around steel beams
isn't my only trick!

16:07.210 --> 16:10.373
I'll give you a taste
of my ultra-heavy punch!

16:10.814 --> 16:13.578
I'll show you
an ultra-ultra-heavy punch!

16:16.353 --> 16:19.288
Magnetic punch!

16:32.402 --> 16:35.735
You're about a hundred years
away from being able to...

16:35.805 --> 16:37.102
...beat me with that power!

16:38.708 --> 16:40.073
I wonder...

16:42.679 --> 16:43.509
Mari!

16:43.580 --> 16:45.514
It may not work on you...

16:45.582 --> 16:48.642
...but I bet my punch
would really work on her.

16:49.986 --> 16:50.816
Mom!

16:51.521 --> 16:52.852
How cowardly!

16:52.922 --> 16:54.321
You're a Company man...

16:54.391 --> 16:57.417
...and you're going to put an
Underground dweller in peril?!

16:57.560 --> 16:58.492
Shut up!

16:58.928 --> 17:02.329
These people are able to live here
thanks to the Company!

17:02.599 --> 17:05.534
They are completely
subservient to the Company!

17:05.602 --> 17:08.230
I think you're mistaken.

17:08.672 --> 17:11.038
Now, don't move.

17:11.274 --> 17:13.765
You're the one that shouldn't move.

17:14.010 --> 17:14.669
What?!

17:15.178 --> 17:18.944
Rumina Asagi, master swordsman,
to the rescue!

17:21.785 --> 17:24.049
Damn! The wind user kid!

17:24.587 --> 17:26.282
Where'd you come from?!

17:27.524 --> 17:28.923
Go for it!

17:29.059 --> 17:32.153
Those kids showed me a shortcut.

17:32.829 --> 17:35.093
A shortcut so that
I can defeat you!

17:35.532 --> 17:36.658
Why, you!

17:39.769 --> 17:41.760
Asagi Swordsmanship!

17:46.042 --> 17:49.068
Gale Force Wind!

17:55.351 --> 17:58.286
T-To think a wind user
could have this much power...

17:59.322 --> 18:00.414
Yay!

18:00.490 --> 18:03.220
I never thought a surface dweller
could be good!

18:04.427 --> 18:06.258
What took you so long?

18:06.529 --> 18:07.393
Blondie!

18:08.264 --> 18:11.563
I'm just a little tired.

18:11.735 --> 18:14.203
I want to take a little rest.

18:14.471 --> 18:15.597
Okay?

18:17.207 --> 18:18.936
Take your time.

18:19.309 --> 18:21.869
Hey, Ginnosuke! Give me a hand!

18:22.946 --> 18:23.844
Where's Ginnosuke?

18:24.748 --> 18:27.216
That Company man is gone too!

18:37.093 --> 18:41.325
Huh?
It wasn't this road, was it?

18:45.468 --> 18:48.926
It seems like I'm totally lost.

18:49.773 --> 18:51.673
I hope Chelsea's okay.

18:52.342 --> 18:54.674
I wonder what happened
to Rumina?

18:57.313 --> 18:58.644
Someone's coming!

18:58.948 --> 18:59.812
Hey!

19:03.586 --> 19:06.646
Hey! You're one of
Chelsea Rorec's friends!

19:06.723 --> 19:07.553
What?

19:07.624 --> 19:09.888
Have we met somewhere before?

19:10.527 --> 19:13.621
The only people I've met
since coming here...

19:13.696 --> 19:16.756
...are the people of the village,
and...

19:20.203 --> 19:21.534
A-are you...

19:21.604 --> 19:24.368
...the man who was throwing
those steel beams?

19:24.440 --> 19:26.635
I suppose I can't hide it.

19:26.776 --> 19:29.506
Your friends beat me up
pretty good.

19:29.579 --> 19:32.878
Oh, that means Rumina
and Chelsea won!

19:33.016 --> 19:34.506
Thank goodness for that!

19:34.717 --> 19:36.184
There's nothing good about it!

19:36.252 --> 19:39.050
I'll take my revenge out on you!

19:43.693 --> 19:47.151
Take this! My Magnetic punch!

19:47.230 --> 19:49.164
Ow! Ow! That's hot!

19:50.233 --> 19:51.427
Hot?

19:52.001 --> 19:52.865
Flames?

19:55.405 --> 19:57.873
I need to work on its accuracy
a little more.

19:58.107 --> 20:00.575
Y-You! What're you doing?!

20:00.643 --> 20:02.611
That's what I should be asking you.

20:02.812 --> 20:05.576
As you can see,
this boy is unarmed.

20:05.849 --> 20:10.309
I can't ignore a grown man
picking on a young boy like that.

20:11.988 --> 20:13.888
This time I won't miss.

20:14.290 --> 20:15.780
Damn!

20:16.426 --> 20:17.825
You better remember this!

20:18.661 --> 20:20.026
Are you all right?

20:20.096 --> 20:20.687
Huh?

20:27.470 --> 20:29.404
Have you been hurt?

20:44.621 --> 20:49.524
Kyoumo uso no youni

20:49.592 --> 20:55.462
migakareru machi nami wo

20:55.531 --> 21:07.841
mokuteki ga aruyou ni
aruku boku

21:08.678 --> 21:19.486
naiteruno?
Honno sasayaka na kakotachi yo

21:19.555 --> 21:31.365
miagereba
DIGITAL no SCREEN ni sora ga...

21:31.868 --> 21:40.799
kaze no uta wo
takai kaidan wo nobori

21:40.877 --> 21:44.643
kikou to shita

21:44.714 --> 21:52.712
daite
amaku kizu tsuita yume ga mou

21:52.789 --> 22:01.629
same temo ii
nakanaide

22:10.740 --> 22:12.708
Preview

22:12.775 --> 22:17.906
Rumina and Chelsea are both
risking their lives as they fight.

22:18.181 --> 22:20.581
But all I can do is to stand by
and watch.

22:20.717 --> 22:23.914
I don't want to hold them back
anymore.

22:24.487 --> 22:25.954
If only I possessed a power.

22:26.189 --> 22:28.453
I want a power.

22:28.825 --> 22:31.521
Huh? What is that gun?

22:32.061 --> 22:34.859
Next time on
Tokyo Underground...

22:34.931 --> 22:35.932
..."The Spirit Gun - To Fight Together".

22:35.932 --> 22:40.562
The Spirit Gun - To Fight Together
..."The Spirit Gun - To Fight Together".
